# If this file is present, EAS Build uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore to
# decide what to upload as the build context. We mirror .gitignore here so
# the upload stays slim, but we deliberately allow `.env` so Metro can
# inline EXPO_PUBLIC_* into the production bundle.
#
# `.env` is never committed (see .gitignore). It is written on the GitHub
# Actions runner from repo secrets just before `eas build` runs, exists
# for the upload window only, and is discarded with the runner.

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
ios/
android/
expo-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
.github/
.git/
